# Fetched weather. Unlike season_mods.ltx and season_staged.ltx - which ship neutral
# because the MCM page reads them - this one is dated observations for one machine on one
# day, and its ABSENCE is a supported state: the game falls back to climate normals and
# says so. _tools/fetch_weather.py writes it; play.bat runs that before launch.
mods/Seasons of the Zone/gamedata/configs/season_weather.ltx
